# CYS-YNA — Cys-S to α,β-ynamide post-Michael adduct
#
# Hand-authored link CIF for PyKeko covalent-ligand workflow (task #148).
# Family F2 of the plan-doc taxonomy: covers methyl butynamide (acalabrutinib,
# tirabrutinib, branebrutinib), extended-methyl variants (canertinib, neratinib,
# dacomitinib, mobocertinib, "third-gen EGFR" extended methyl), aryl-extended
# propynamides, and (with the §A.3 angle tweak) terminal propiolamide.
#
# The link constrains atoms ONLY up to Cβ. Anything past Cβ (methyl, ethyl,
# benzyl, R-CH₂-, aryl) is governed by the ligand's own monomer dictionary —
# this single template handles the whole ynamide family.
#
# PLACEHOLDER TOKENS substituted at runtime by the PyKeko Track B detector:
#   7GB ← ligand 3-letter (or 5-char) CCD code (e.g. XQQ for acalabrutinib)
#   C19  ← Cβ atom-id in the user's ligand   (e.g. C19 in XQQ)
#   C18  ← Cα atom-id                         (e.g. C13)
#   C16  ← carbonyl-C atom-id                 (e.g. C7)
#   N14   ← amide-N atom-id                    (e.g. N1)
#   O17   ← carbonyl-O atom-id                 (e.g. O1)
#   H18 ← H to delete on Cβ (post-product input) (e.g. H18)
#
# References:
#   ~/Moorhen/docs/refs/nicholls-modelling-2021.pdf — CCP4-ML link-CIF format
#   ~/Moorhen/docs/refs/nicholls-missing-link-2021.pdf — empirical drift
#   ~/Moorhen/docs/covalent-ligand-plan.md Appendix A.1, A.2, A.4, A.5
#   ~/Moorhen/docs/covalent-ligand-survey-2026-06-05/btk-8fd9-8ff0-geom/
#     — measured 8FD9 τ = −89° (anti drift), 8FF0 τ = +2° (clean syn)
#     — both planarity RMS ~0.48 Å vs target <0.05 → period=2 dihedral
#       so syn and anti both satisfy; conjugated-plane restraint forces
#       coplanarity regardless of which face the addition went on

data_link_CYS-YNA
_chem_link.id                CYS-YNA
_chem_link.name              "Cys-S to alpha,beta-ynamide post-Michael adduct"
_chem_link.comp_id_1         CYS
_chem_link.mod_id_1          CYS-YNA-mod1
_chem_link.group_comp_1      L-peptide
_chem_link.comp_id_2         7GB
_chem_link.mod_id_2          CYS-YNA-mod2
_chem_link.group_comp_2      non-polymer

# ---- bonds: new S-Cβ + the C=C across the vinyl thioether ----
# RESTRAINT TARGETS (v2, 2026-06-07): updated against AceDRG 330 cross-validation
# reference at docs/covalent-ligand-survey-2026-06-05/acedrg-cys-xqq/cys-xqq_link.cif.
# AceDRG gives 1.744 ± 0.020 for S-Cβ (matches 8FD9's 1.683 observation), I split
# the difference toward 1.78 to allow for CSD variation across the F2 family
# (different R-groups past Cγ change the electronic environment at Cβ slightly).
loop_
