# ---- angles around the new sp2 carbon ----
# v2: ESDs tightened from 3.0° to 1.5° on the sp2 angles per AceDRG, which uses
# CSD aggregate statistics. The CB-SG-Cβ angle (Cys side) stays at σ=3.0 since
# the sp3 S has more conformational freedom than the planar sp2 carbon.
loop_
_chem_link_angle.atom_1_comp_id
